{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Stock Calculators 是一款為股票投資者而設的計算工具，把回報、股息、風險與估值四方面的數字集中處理，適合在買入股票或調整持倉前快速核對。軟件原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-77.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四款計算工具涵蓋回報與風險</h2>\n<p>App 內建四款計算工具。Stock Return 計算賺蝕金額與百分比，並以假設情境推算止蝕或止賺價位；Dividend Yield 按季度派息推算股息率，與銀行利息及債券回報比較；Beta 分析股票相對大市的波動，衡量風險與潛在回報；P/E Ratio 以市盈率判斷股價偏高、合理還是偏低。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-320-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-321-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-322-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-323-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-324-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Stock Calculators</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/stock-calculators/id6736713867?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:20:13.091391+00:00","